            <div class="col-md-6 text-nowrap">
                <table class="table-responsive col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 tableMarginBottomZero">
                    &nbsp;Selection Tips
                    <br />
                    &nbsp;You may select from 1 to 5 races.
                    <br />
                    &nbsp;Your races will be displayed in a external
                    <br />&nbsp;browser window. Popups must be enabled.
                    <ul>
                        <li>CTRL-click to select multiples</li>
                        <li>SHIFT-click to select a range or multiple ranges.</li>
                        <li>
                            Click and drag to select a continuous range, then press CTRL key and select additional
                            ranges.
                        </li>
                        <li>To unselect, CTRL-click the selected item.</li>
                    </ul>
                </table>
                <br />
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 text-nowrap horizontal-left40">
                <div class="btn-group-vertical">
                    <input type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" id="mylink" name="mylink" value="Show My Races" />
                    <div class="height10"></div>
                    <input type="button" class="btn" id="btnClear" name="clear" value="Clear Selections" />
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </form>

        </div>
    </main>

